---
---
<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="section__container">
    <div class="section__header">
      <span class="section__number">01</span>
      <h2 class="section__title">ABOUT<span class="accent">_</span></h2>
      <div class="section__line"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="about__grid">
      <div class="about__block about__block--main reveal">
        <div class="about__tag">// WHO WE ARE</div>
        <h3 class="about__headline">We turn AI curiosity into<br>confident, working capability<span class="accent">.</span></h3>
        <p class="about__text">
          EmberMind Labs is an AI consulting and education venture. We sit at the
          intersection of strategy, teaching, and real implementation &mdash;
          helping teams move past the hype and put artificial intelligence to
          work where it actually matters.
        </p>
        <p class="about__text">
          The spark of a good idea is only the beginning. Our job is to fan it
          into something durable: a clear strategy, a team that understands the
          tools, and systems that ship. We light the path from idea to impact.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="about__block about__block--stats reveal">
        <div class="about__stat-card">
          <span class="about__stat-icon">&#9670;</span>
          <span class="about__stat-title">CONSULTING</span>
          <span class="about__stat-desc">Strategy, roadmaps, and honest guidance on where AI fits &mdash; and where it doesn't</span>
        </div>
        <div class="about__stat-card">
          <span class="about__stat-icon">&#9650;</span>
          <span class="about__stat-title">EDUCATION</span>
          <span class="about__stat-desc">Workshops and training that build real fluency for teams, leaders, and learners</span>
        </div>
        <div class="about__stat-card">
          <span class="about__stat-icon">&#10022;</span>
          <span class="about__stat-title">IMPLEMENTATION</span>
          <span class="about__stat-desc">Hands-on builds &mdash; from prototypes to production AI woven into your workflow</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    background: var(--dark);
    position: relative;
  }

  .about::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--accent), transparent 50%);
  }

  .about__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about__block--main {
    padding-right: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .about__tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .about__headline {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .about__text {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--gray-light);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .about__block--stats {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
  }

  .about__stat-card {
    padding: var(--space-md);
    border: 1px solid var(--gray-dark);
    border-bottom: none;
    position: relative;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .about__stat-card:last-child {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gray-dark);
  }

  .about__stat-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 2px;
    background: var(--accent);
    transform: scaleY(0);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .about__stat-card:hover::before {
    transform: scaleY(1);
  }

  .about__stat-card:hover {
    background: var(--dark-mid);
    border-color: var(--accent-dim);
  }

  .about__stat-icon {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .about__stat-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .about__stat-desc {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--gray-light);
    line-height: 1.5;
    display: block;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .about__block--main {
      padding-right: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
